    "\u{1b}[97;100m    \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m<\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[95;100mscript\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m>\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[3;96;100mvar\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100mx\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[95;100m=\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[97;100m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m<\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m/\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[95;100mbody\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m>\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m           \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[97;100m<\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m/\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[95;100mhtml\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m>\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m             \u{1b}[0m\n" +
