    "\u{1b}[97;100m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m-\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100mone                                                                         \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[97;100m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m-\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;100m\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;100mtwo\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;100m\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m                                                                       \u{1b}[0m\n" +
