    "\u{1b}[107m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;107m3 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;32;107m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[107m-\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;107m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[107mone\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[107m                                                                     \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[107m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;107m4 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;32;107m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[107m-\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;107m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[33;107m\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[33;107mtwo\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[33;107m\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[107m                                                                   \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[107m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;107m5 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;32;107mnested\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[30;107m:\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[107m                                                                     \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[107m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;107m6 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;32;107m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;32;107mnumber\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[30;107m:\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;107m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[107m42\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;107m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[3;32;107m# comment\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[107m                                                     \u{1b}[0m\n"
