    "\u{1b}[2;3;90;107m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[32;107mecho\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;107m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[31;107m\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[31;107mfile: \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[34;107m$f\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[31;107m\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;107m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[30;107m|\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;107m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[30;107mgrep\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;107m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[30;107m-v\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;107m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[31;107m'^#'\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;107m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[30;107m>\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;107m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[30;107m/dev/null\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[107m                                    \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[1;32;107mdone\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[107m                                                                            \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[32;107mexport\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;107m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[34;107mX\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[90;107m=\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;90;107m${\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[34;107mHOME\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;32;107m:-\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[30;107m/tmp\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;90;107m}\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[107m                                                          \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[107m                                                                                \u{1b}[0m\n"
