    "\u{1b}[100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;100m1 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[3;90;100m#!/bin/bash\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m                                                               \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;100m2 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;37;100mfor\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100mf\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;37;100min\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m*.txt\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m;\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;37;100mdo\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m                                                        \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;100m3 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;100mecho\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;100m\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;100mfile: \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m$f\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;100m\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m|\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100mgrep\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m-v\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;100m'^#'\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m>\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m/dev/null\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m                              \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;100m4 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;37;100mdone\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m                                                                      \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;100m5 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;100mexport\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100mX\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;37;100m=\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;100m${\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100mHOME\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[1;37;100m:-\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;100m/tmp\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[37;100m}\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m                                                    \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[100m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m  \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[2;100m6 \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m                                                                          \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[100m \u{1b}[0m\n" +
    "\u{1b}[100m                                                                                \u{1b}[0m\n"
