    "\u{1b}[90;40m        \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;40mfmt\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;40m.\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;40mPrintln\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;40m(\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[96;40m\"hi\"\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;40m,\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[90;40m \u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;40mlen\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;40m(\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;40mch\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;40m)\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[97;40m)\u{1b}[0m\u{1b}[40m                                              \u{1b}[0m\n" +
